   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **September 2021 (Saturday)**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2021-09-25.vwmule** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 145 min; rated 4.5/5 by 2 [1]. Said about its sound: The reviewer states the recording captured great sound quality [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Durand Jones & The Indications opened the concert at the Greek Theatre [1]\n- Attendees needed proof of full vaccination or a negative test to enter [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2021-09-25.vwmule**: taped by Alex Leary; transferred by Alex Leary; source: Microtech Gefell M21 > nBob actives > Sound Devices MixPre-6 (24/48) [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by D.King Gallery: [Chandler Reed My Morning Jacket Poster](https://www.dking-gallery.com/store/MyMorningJacket_Greek2021.html) [5]",
